Description: Fits penalized regression models that combine multiview integration
    with multistudy pretraining and transfer learning. Legacy PCL-style lists
    and MultiAssayExperiment inputs support Gaussian, binomial, and Cox
    outcomes. Cross-validation selects view-fusion and
    transfer-learning parameters while preserving study-specific predictions.
